{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-9","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与连比例与比例","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to one another, and numbers fall between them in continued proportion, then, however many numbers fall between them in continued proportion, so many will also fall between each of them and an unit in continued proportion.","book":8,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","contentId":"euclid-8-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9f5e73fdc0d17759ca7e0125781e4ae9e49abaf34559cdb8032a6cf00e2936a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-9.statement","euclid-8-9.construction.1","euclid-8-9.construction.2","euclid-8-9.construction.3","euclid-8-9.proof.1","euclid-8-9.proof.2","euclid-8-9.proof.3","euclid-8-9.proof.4","euclid-8-9.proof.5","euclid-8-9.proof.6","euclid-8-9.proof.7","euclid-8-9.proof.8","euclid-8-9.proof.9","euclid-8-9.proof.10","euclid-8-9.proof.11","euclid-8-9.conclusion","euclid-8-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f451bdd2a6cc5c5fb9a0b963d29aa2733e7366269fc456098d27f1651524e16","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to one another, and numbers fall between them in continued proportion, then, however many numbers fall between them in continued proportion, so many will also fall between each of them and an unit in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字是互素, 数字在连比例之间下降, 那么,无论数字在连比例之间多少下降, 所以很多数字也会在连比例之间下降, 每一个数字和单位个数字在连比例之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f78ab65a50d11c90283236363a55a8c779a8d0d0672a91cb3b9f77a4dff8eaec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two numbers prime to one another, and let C, D fall between them in continued proportion, and let the unit E be set out; I say that, as many numbers as fall between A, B in continued proportion, so many will also fall between either of the numbers A, B and the unit in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为2号互素,让C,D在连比例中掉下来,让单位,E被列出;我说,连比例中A,B中的人数将多达A,B中的人数将下降至连比例中的单位。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c59655fbad1f53e0456f8bcce1a43b313391fff71c3ce77c5402f5068d1ee00c","citations":["euclid-8-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let two numbers F, G, the least that are in the ratio of A, C, D, B, be taken, three numbers H, K, L with the same property, and others more by one continually, until their multitude is equal to the multitude of A, C, D, B. [[VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"取出两个F,G, 最少是A, C,D,B, 三个H,K,L, 同一财产, 其余一个一个不断, 直到它们的总数等于A, C,D,B。 [[VIII. 2](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"890197100c54984f73002a1e67af70e4c886edf4c9d367707584b864809de0b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be taken, and let them be M, N, O, P."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们被带走,让它们成为M,N,O,P。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58f12eaa8d54f6df77babe66c211b262de95b7792a6e5008067ef07c6effb827","citations":["euclid-8-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is now manifest that F by multiplying itself has made H and by multiplying H has made M, while G by multiplying itself has made L and by multiplying L has made P. [[VIII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在很明显,F乘以H,H乘以M,G乘以L,L乘以P。 [[VIII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-8-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d01d3373298f3bedea19b0e8aaa8ffa78b3fcbe80389f989b7eb3a42e352c1b7","citations":["euclid-8-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since M, N, O, P are the least of those which have the same ratio with F, G, and A, C, D, B are also the least of those which have the same ratio with F, G, [[VIII. 1](/principles/euclid-8-1)] while the multitude of the numbers M, N, O, P is equal to the multitude of the numbers A, C, D, B, therefore M, N, O, P are equal to A, C, D, B respectively; therefore M is equal to A, and P to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 M、N、O、P 是与 F、G 具有相同比例的最小整数，而 A、C、D、B 也是与 F、G 具有相同比例的最小整数，并且两组整数的项数相等，所以 M、N、O、P 分别等于 A、C、D、B；因此 M 等于 A，P 等于 B。 [[VIII. 1](/principles/euclid-8-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a4f9835a8faf476c7ff885aab46a3e2d05b56e78a6fbbb366ea5b65e95b4b84","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since F by multiplying itself has made H, therefore F measures H according to the units in F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,F乘以本身 已经达到H, 因此,F 整除 H 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e674974c6e5708e3bed5c86217e186d6dcea94d1c126d19610c6da13a26c737d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit E also measures F according to the units in it; therefore the unit E measures the number F the same number of times as F measures H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,单位,E,整除,F,单位,E,F,F乘以F,整除,H。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"768a48acad9a965c169ae86c74da7cd93d779e27f299a121c5551701fd17109b","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the unit E is to the number F, so is F to H. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位 E与F的比等于F与H的比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a83b41e467ee193342a437b73605a5001a0222c8826fc0fea52607e90f57a5f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since F by multiplying H has made M, therefore H measures M according to the units in F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F乘以H, 使M, 因此,根据F的单位, F的H, 整除, M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8de41dc98e96eb7dd1861ecaaacee078d38570e4c3263ad8af30521bbd302eb7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit E also measures the number F according to the units in it; therefore the unit E measures the number F the same number of times as H measures M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,单位,E也是整除,因此,单位,E,整除,F乘以H,整除,M。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8fd9ab09d3981b06b2142bfbcc54c79104fb1f20867ee6dfad35a1af349dfe9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the unit E is to the number F, so is H to M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位 E与F的比等于H与M的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b1ecc63f2ce001558226320d72833405f679cc8ebc7082876c2cbb898cea6e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as the unit E is to the number F, so is F to H; therefore also, as the unit E is to the number F, so is F to H, and H to M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有事实证明,单位 E与F的比等于F与H的比;因此,单位 E与F的比等于F与H的比,H与M的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cbcd88fd087c62831e643549d821761fec03793e5492fd96533279e480a5b1a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But M is equal to A; therefore, as the unit E is to the number F, so is F to H, and H to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但M等于A;因此,单位 E与F之比等于F与H之比,H与A之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cce12b84dc0c875a4c88635d9e0f907f3673ba096ad124153b04a8b99c3ee4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as the unit E is to the number G, so is G to L and L to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,单位 E与G的比等于G与L和L与B的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7b1d76ec90e7dbe7cf352d7b5070be9c6dae271518fa1d2d4a412d0504c7b49","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as many numbers as have fallen between A, B in continued proportion, so many numbers also have fallen between each of the numbers A, B and the unit E in continued proportion. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,连比例,人数在A至B之间,而A至B至连比例的单位之间,人数也减少了A至B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-9.source","contentId":"euclid-8-9","revisionId":"euclid-8-9@raw-a9f5e73fdc0d1775","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"089a7f6c3d005a22f15fc5217fd863a9f8bba40f221a57352e63e19511bc7474","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-9:euclid-8-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-9.construction.2","euclid-8-9.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-9:euclid-8-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-9.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-9:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-9.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-8-9:euclid-8-2:explicit","id":"euclid-8-2","book":8,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：连比例与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-8-9:euclid-8-1:explicit","id":"euclid-8-1","book":8,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"连续比例数列与互素首末项","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-8-9:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-20","book":7,"number":20,"kind":"definition","title":"成比例的整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
